 "text": "Here's the simple cheat sheet for Bullish vs Bearish EMA trends.\n\nBullish EMA trend 📈\n\n13 EMA on top 🟡\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n200 EMA on bottim 🔴\n\nThese EMA's will be your ares of support in an uptrend. (Dip to get long)\n\nBearish EMA trend 📉\n\n200 EMA on top 🔴\n48 EMA in middle https://t.co/VYRtrW3cyy",
